# Each crime triggers it separately (CR 700.13, 603.2): on turn three Bot1 casts two Shocks at Bot2 with a Mountain and Mox
# Ruby, so two triggers go on the stack. With the Apothecary the only creature Bot1 controls, each targets it; the first
# resolution chooses lifelink and the second menace, so it has deathtouch, lifelink and menace until end of turn (CR 611.2a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Rattleback Apothecary
Mountain
Shock
Shock
Swamp
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
